<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-ROKISHKIS H1 NET PROFIT LEAPS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-ROKISHKIS H1 NET PROFIT LEAPS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997,</p>
<p>				  (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			9.467	   vs 1.253</p>
<p>    Turnover			  70.19	   vs 38.4</p>
<p>    Operating costs		 58.287	  vs 35.54</p>
<p>    Operating profit		9.419	   vs 1.69</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gains	   47,242 litas  vs 602 litas</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  9.467	   vs 1.69</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    11.91	   vs 2.83</p>
<p>NOTES -- Cheese maker Rokishkis does not pay profit tax as</p>
<p>foreign investments are more than $2 million. The first half</p>
<p>include results of two branches in Zarasai and Ukmerge while</p>
<p>results for H1 1996 inlude the results of Zarasai only.</p>
<p>The company expects to have audited results for the first</p>
<p>half of 1997 in around a month, finance officer Valerija</p>
<p>Shimeniene told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
